sequenceDiagram
    participant UF as URL Frontier
    participant FW as Fetcher Worker
    participant DNS as DNS Resolver
    participant PL as Politeness Limiter
    participant WS as Web Server
    participant PE as Parser & Extractor
    participant BF as Bloom Filter

    UF->>FW: Dequeue URL
    FW->>DNS: Resolve domain to IP
    DNS-->>FW: Return IP address
    FW->>PL: Check rate limit/delay
    PL-->>FW: Permit granted
    FW->>WS: Fetch HTML content
    WS-->>FW: HTML response
    FW->>PE: Forward HTML
    PE->>PE: Parse and extract links
    loop For each extracted link
        PE->>BF: Check deduplication
        alt Link is new
            BF-->>PE: Not seen
            PE->>UF: Enqueue new URL
        else Link already seen
            BF-->>PE: Seen
        end
    end
